{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13201110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13201110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320111001:0":{"text":"咦，怎么给它食物也不理睬了。","source_cn":"咦，怎么给它食物也不理睬了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79CA2F1CD6D591B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320111002:0":{"text":"它又在涂涂画画了，到底想表达什么呢？","source_cn":"它又在涂涂画画了，到底想表达什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x482A2373405AA82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320111003:0":{"text":"看起来有点像是字……可这根本看不懂啊。","source_cn":"看起来有点像是字……可这根本看不懂啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C53D111E53A76F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320111004:1":{"text":"它居然都成长到可以领悟文字的程度了吗！","source_cn":"它居然都成长到可以领悟文字的程度了吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B734663C33B0280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320111005:1":{"text":"虽然完全看不懂……还需要经过一段时间学习。","source_cn":"虽然完全看不懂……还需要经过一段时间学习。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x549F04010810BB35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320111006:1":{"text":"